# One agent's call into HQ: its own token, the pause switch, its grant, the operator's policy, then a run, a hold or a refusal, each recorded under its name.
title: An agent's call
subtitle: /mcp/ and /api/v2/
direction: down

Agent [icon: bot, note: its own access token]

Doors [dashed] {
  MCP [icon: terminal, note: /mcp/ · capped by settings]
  Machine API [icon: globe, note: /api/v2/ · Idempotency-Key]
}

Pause [icon: lock, note: every agent · fails closed]
Grant [icon: key, note: what the token was granted]
Policy [icon: shield, anchor, note: allow · hold · deny]
Run [icon: database, note: one transaction · audited]
Person [icon: user, note: approves in the web UI]
Refused [icon: firewall, note: 403 denied_by_policy · audited]

Agent > Doors > Pause > Grant > Policy
Policy > Run: allowed
Policy > Person: held
Policy > Refused: denied
Person > Run: runs as the agent
